# 1. PRODUCT OBJECTIVE

Build a web application for managing a classroom of 48 students.

The teacher must be able to:
- Create and manage classrooms.
- Create presentation rooms and scoring sessions.
- Manage 48 student accounts and passwords.
- Divide students into 8 groups by default.
- Customize the number of groups and members per group.
- Allow students to log in and select their own groups when permitted.
- Assign students to groups manually or automatically.
- Score presentations live during classroom activities.
- Record comments and feedback for every group.
- View real-time scoring results.
- Generate final rankings and comprehensive summaries.
- Export results and preserve historical assessment records.

The system must remain reliable when many students access it simultaneously.

Core principle:

**Data correctness > Reliability > Usability > Performance > Visual design > Decorative animation.**

Never sacrifice data integrity for visual effects or implementation convenience.

